{
  // WAYFARER'S ROAD, THE FREE TRACK - Docs/DESIGN-WAYFARERS-ROAD.md. A 28 day season of 30 tiers.
  // Points come only from the daily loop's claims (orders, the daily chest, the weekly chest), so the
  // pass feeds the loop and nothing else feeds the pass. Every reward is fixed and shown up front.
  //
  // NOT PART OF ContentDatabase.ContentVersion, for guild-path.json's reason: nothing here is read by a
  // fight. ContentDatabase.LoadWayfarersRoad reads it after Load. The whole pass is behind
  // WayfarersRoadSwitch (on by default; EMBERFALL_WAYFARERS_ROAD_OFF rolls it back) and, because its
  // points are the daily loop's claims, it earns nothing while DailyLoopSwitch is off.
  //
  // SEASONS are back to back from "epoch" (a Monday, so a season is exactly four reward-day weeks),
  // each seasonDays long, turning over on the reward day (04:00 UTC, balance.json). Unclaimed tiers
  // lapse with the season.
  //
  // SIZING. A day on which a player claims all five orders and the daily chest is 5 x 8 + 12 = 52
  // points; a tier is 40 points, so 30 tiers are 1,200 points, and 24 such days finish the track
  // (24 x 52 = 1,248) while 23 do not (1,196). The weekly chest adds 40 points on a week of five
  // complete days. CheckWayfarersRoadSizing proves both numbers against orders.json.
  //
  // REWARDS. hourglass: hours of idle income at the frontier (the one idle formula, as the loop pays).
  // dust: that many repeat-clear payouts of the frontier stage (RelicDustForRepeatClear), so it scales
  // with the player. slag: Slag, a fixed amount, free (earned) Slag. selector: one hero of that many
  // stars the player picks, a plain earned copy, NEVER Sealed. cosmetic: paid track only.
  //
  // THE PAID TRACK is data and a locked row on screen, behind PassPaidSwitch (define EMBERFALL_PASS_PAID,
  // which stays off). There is no purchase path: nothing in the game can unlock it.
  //
  // buyTier: a tier can be bought with Valor or Coda (earned currencies only), priced in days of that
  // purse's income (SinkPricing), at most maxPerSeason a season.
  "seasonDays": 28,
  "epoch": "2026-01-05",
  "tierPoints": 40,
  "points": { "order": 8, "dailyChest": 12, "weeklyChest": 40 },
  "buyTier": { "days": 2, "maxPerSeason": 3 },
